      "text": "## Hotels & prices   Per person in USD\n\n10D / 9N\n\n| Accommodation | Number of guests travelling together | Total per person (USD) |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| SGL | 1 | $6,250 |\n| DBL | 2 | $3,289 |\n| TRP | 3 | $3,089 |\n\n| City | Hotel | Nights | Room | Meals |\n|---|---|---:|---|---|\n| São Paulo | Slaviero São Paulo Ibirapuera | 2 | Standard | Breakfast |\n| Rio de Janeiro | Arena Leme | 3 | Standard | Breakfast |\n| Salvador | Vila Galé Salvador | 1 | Standard | Breakfast |\n| Praia do Forte | Pousada Casa do Forte | 3 | Standard | Breakfast |\n\nOr similar hotels.\n\nCurrency: USD. Year: 2027.\n\n## Important information\n\nInternational flights are not included. Domestic flights São Paulo – Rio de Janeiro – Salvador are not included (from $ 800 per person).\n\nAll services and hotels are subject to availability at the time of booking.\n\nEnglish-speaking guides",
